      "message": "fix: address review — tick-sized tolerance, Manifest version, carry Sidecar bytes, encoder changes\n\n- tolerance 4m so a late cron Run followed by an on-time one never skips a cycle (#2)\n- Manifest carries a schema version; other versions mean full regenerate (#5)\n- Sidecars carried byte-for-byte; regenerated Frames get a fresh next_due (#5)\n- a Panel whose encoders changed is regenerated (#10)\n- window days type-checked; convert accepts config Panels; Encoder type; tests use hand oracles\n- runner font setup: Debian package ships no Black weight",
